# Mobile App Design Assets

This document contains the design tokens and UI references to ensure the mobile app matches the web design perfectly.

## Brand Identity

### Colors
| Name | Hex Code | Usage |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Primary** | `#e84118` | Main actions, branding, active states |
| **Primary Dark** | `#c73410` | Hover states, pressed buttons |
| **Primary Light** | `#ff6b4a` | Subtle accents, light backgrounds |
| **Secondary** | `#f5a623` | Warnings, special highlights, accents |
| **Dark** | `#1a1a2e` | Main headings, dark theme core |
| **Dark 2** | `#16213e` | Secondary dark backgrounds |
| **Text** | `#2d2d2d` | Primary body text |
| **Text Muted** | `#6b7280` | Descriptions, helper text |
| **Text Light** | `#9ca3af` | Placeholders, disabled states |
| **Background** | `#f7f8fa` | Default app background |
| **Success** | `#10b981` | Success states, verified badges |
| **Warning** | `#f59e0b` | Alerts, attention-seeking elements |

### Typography
- **Headings (H1-H5):** `Poppins`, sans-serif (Weights: 400, 500, 600, 700, 800)
- **Body Text:** `Inter`, sans-serif (Weights: 300, 400, 500, 600, 700)

## Layout & Components

### Spacing & Radius
- **Base Radius:** `12px` (`--radius`)
- **Small Radius:** `8px` (`--radius-sm`)
- **Large Radius:** `20px` (`--radius-lg`)
- **Container Max Width:** `1280px`

### UI Tokens
- **Shadow (Standard):** `0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)`
- **Shadow (Card):** `0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)`
- **Transition:** `all 0.3s ease`

### Common Elements
- **Badges:** Pill-shaped (20px radius), 11px font size, semi-bold.
- **Buttons:** 14px font size, 10px 22px padding, 600 weight.
- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)` with semi-transparent white backgrounds (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)`) for premium overlays.

## visual Reference
- **Theme:** Modern, clean, Real Estate focused.
- **Vibe:** Premium feel with subtle shadows and rounded corners.
